      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Four words before we start. Advisory: text Claude reads and tries to follow — CLAUDE.md is this. Deterministic: enforced by the operating system, not by Claude's judgment — a hook is this. PreToolUse hook: a shell script Claude Code runs before every tool call, fed the call as JSON on standard input. Exit 2: the exit code the script returns to say block this tool call; Claude sees the message and re-reasons.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 25.7,
